.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt PROTON 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm proton
.Nd run Windows programs with the GE-Proton compatibility runtime
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm /opt/proton/proton
.Ar command
.Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The x86-64 GNU root installs GE-Proton11-12 under
.Pa /opt/proton .
The launcher uses the compatibility directory named by
.Ev STEAM_COMPAT_DATA_PATH .
A caller supplies the prefix and launch environment before running a Windows program.
Steam is not installed by the image.
.Pp
The release contains Wine, DXVK and vkd3d-proton.
DXVK and vkd3d-proton use Vulkan;
.Ev PROTON_USE_WINED3D=1
selects WineD3D instead.
.Ev PROTON_USE_WOW64=1
selects the release's WoW64 path.
The graphics runners choose and record the renderer and prefix.
.Pp
On lavapipe the qualified Direct3D limit is feature level 11_1 and shader model 6.0.
Haswell uses WineD3D rather than these Vulkan translators.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /opt/proton
.It Pa /opt/proton
The pinned release, its launcher, runtime, licenses and notices.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vulkaninfo 1
